 "VO": [
  {
   "text": "Every day starts with a question.",
   "f0": 12,
   "f1": 70
  },
  {
   "text": "Usually before coffee.",
   "f0": 84,
   "f1": 122
  },
  {
   "text": "So you open ChatGPT.",
   "f0": 136,
   "f1": 194
  },
  {
   "text": "Some questions are small…",
   "f0": 209,
   "f1": 249
  },
  {
   "text": "is my sourdough starter dead?",
   "f0": 263,
   "f1": 313
  },
  {
   "text": "It’s not.",
   "f0": 327,
   "f1": 344
  },
  {
   "text": "It’s just hungry.",
   "f0": 352,
   "f1": 377
  },
  {
   "text": "Some are just Monday.",
   "f0": 392,
   "f1": 440
  },
  {
   "text": "A whiteboard full of half-ideas…",
   "f0": 453,
   "f1": 522
  },
  {
   "text": "and ChatGPT turns it into a plan.",
   "f0": 533,
   "f1": 603
  },
  {
   "text": "And some only come out at 3 a.m. …",
   "f0": 618,
   "f1": 692
  },
  {
   "text": "when the house is quiet,",
   "f0": 704,
   "f1": 740
  },
  {
   "text": "and you need the right words for someone you love.",
   "f0": 749,
   "f1": 822
  },
  {
   "text": "Emails.",
   "f0": 838,
   "f1": 857
  },
  {
   "text": "Dinner.",
   "f0": 865,
   "f1": 879
  },
  {
   "text": "Trips.",
   "f0": 888,
   "f1": 903
  },
  {
   "text": "Bugs.",
   "f0": 910,
   "f1": 929
  },
  {
   "text": "Big questions, silly ones,",
   "f0": 942,
   "f1": 999
  },
  {
   "text": "the ones you’d never say out loud.",
   "f0": 1008,
   "f1": 1060
  },
  {
   "text": "Whatever’s on your mind…",
   "f0": 1073,
   "f1": 1107
  },
  {
   "text": "ChatGPT.",
   "f0": 1119,
   "f1": 1147
  },
  {
   "text": "Ask anything.",
   "f0": 1159,
   "f1": 1187
  }
